# Kane CLI local assurance store.
# Intentionally NOT ignored: `kane-cli cover` and `kane-cli maintain` need the
# live graph, and committing it lets the PRD hash be diffed across commits.
# It is append-only and single-writer, so never write to it from two places at
# once; on a conflict, regenerate rather than hand-merge.
# .context/

# Transient locks and session state inside the store
.context/locks/

# Kane CLI runtime evidence packs
.testmuai/evidence/

# Local Kane CLI session/config artifacts
.testmuai/sessions/
.testmuai/*.log

# Local run outputs (re-created by every execution, uploaded as CI artifacts)
.testmuai/tests/output-*/

# OS/editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
